1. 🔐 Login / Sign Up Page
• Fields:
• Email / Student ID
• Password
• Options:
• Forgot password
• New user? Register
• Redirect:
• After login → Home/Dashboard

⸻

2. 🏠 Home / Dashboard Page
• User selects:
• 📚 “Library Queue”
• 🍽️ “Canteen Queue”
• Also shows:
• Active token (if already joined)
• Estimated waiting time

⸻

3. ➕ Join Queue Page
• Options:
• Select service purpose:
• Library: “Issue Book”, “Return Book”, “Study Table”
• Canteen: “Lunch”, “Snacks”, etc.
• Confirm to get token
• Shows:
• Token number
• Number of people ahead
• Estimated time

⸻

4. 📊 Live Queue Status Page
• Dynamic status update:
• “Now Serving Token #45”
• “You are Token #49 — 4 ahead”
• Real-time updates via WebSocket/Firebase
• Cancel token option

⸻

5. 🔔 Notification Pop-up
• When user’s token is about to come
• Message:
“You’re next! Please be ready.”

⸻

6. 👤 Profile / History Page
• View:
• Past tokens
• Service times
• Feedback given (optional)
• Edit:
• Name, email, password

⸻

7. 📤 Feedback Page (Optional)
• After service:
• Rate service: ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐
• Short comments box

⸻

8. ⚙️ Admin Login Panel (Separate)
• Admin-only login to:
• View/manage queues
• Call next token
• Broadcast messages
